    "directions": [
      "Take whole eggs, break the eggs in a bowl.",
      "Add salt to taste, oil and whisk it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add water as required.",
      "Take a small steel bowl, grease it with oil and pour a ladleful of prepared egg mixture.",
      "Sprinkle some spring onion, green chilli, cover it with a lid and let it cook for 7-8 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Demold the egg mixture and keep it aside for further use.",
      "Take a bowl or any container, add garlic, water, oil and grind it with the hand blender until smooth.",
      "Add oil gradually and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add oil, butter, once it's hot, add garlic, salt to taste, a pinch of sugar and cook it for a while until golden in colour.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a wok, add butter, once it melts, add pineapple and cook it for a minute.",
      "Add prepared sauteed garlic, remaining butter, salt to taste, cooked egg trimmings, cooked rice and toss it on high flames for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Finish it with tender coriander stems, spring onion, prepared garlic sauce, crushed black peppercorns and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with prepared butter garlic eggs.",
      "In a pan, add remaining sauteed garlic, water and give it a quick stir.",
      "Add cooked eggs, crushed black peppercorns, salt to taste, fresh cream and cook it for a minute on high flames.",
      "Finish it with tender coriander stems, fresh coriander leaves, prepared garlic sauce and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with prepared butter garlic egg fried rice."
    ],
